  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire: Combatting Trafficking in Persons in the Mano River Union</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct beneficiaries: The Ministry of Education, the Ministry of Justice, the Ministry of National Cohesion, Solidarity, and the Fight Against Poverty (including the National Committee for the Fight Against Trafficking in Persons).Indirect beneficiaries: Rights holders and duty bearers, victims of trafficking and other forms of exploitation, including women and children, in C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aimed to support the Government of C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire in its efforts to strengthen national systems to address human trafficking.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the Government of C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire in developing evidence based policies and programmes to address trafficking in persons and irregular migration.</narrative>
  </description>
